<title>INDIA: INDIA MOSER IN PREFERENTIAL ISSUE TO IFC.</title>
<headline>INDIA MOSER IN PREFERENTIAL ISSUE TO IFC.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of directors of India's Moser Baer Ltd meets on August 11 to discuss a preferential issue of equity shares to the International Finance Corporation, the Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) said in a notice on Thursday.</p>
<p>No further details were immediately available.</p>
<p>Moser Baer shares were down 0.40 rupees at 18.20 at the National Stock Exchange in Thursday morning deals.</p>
<p>-- Bombay equities desk +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
